    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633690/extras/b19e56053f04533b27716ccbd6079bee.poster.avif?t=1712060492\" width=800 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633690/extras/b19e56053f04533b27716ccbd6079bee.webm?t=1712060492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633690/extras/b19e56053f04533b27716ccbd6079bee.mp4?t=1712060492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>This is a diorama-style game designed purely to let you express your creativity. With its simple and intuitive interface, you can build a floating city in the sky, a lush garden oasis, or a whimsical fairytale scene.  Start with a glass cube with water on a table and let your creativity run wild.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633690/extras/b47dd4d2a48ab976a6e7a58e9363488c.poster.avif?t=1712060492\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633690/extras/b47dd4d2a48ab976a6e7a58e9363488c.webm?t=1712060492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633690/extras/b47dd4d2a48ab976a6e7a58e9363488c.mp4?t=1712060492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>To make your world even more beautiful, you can decorate it with items such as: <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Flowers</strong><br></li><li><strong>Fountains </strong><br></li><li><strong>Trees</strong><br></li><li><strong>Different light sources </strong><br></li><li><strong>Trash bins </strong><br></li><li><strong>Benches, and more</strong> </li></ul><br>Of course, the game has characters to mimic a real-life world. <br><br>No goals or objectives, get creative and build your perfect mini-world. <br><br>Voxelscaper is inspired by games like:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Townscapers<br></li><li>Islanders</li></ul>",
